#: ../../reference_manual/filters.rst:5
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Iragazkiak"

#: ../../reference_manual/filters.rst:7
msgid ""
"Filters are little scripts or operations you can run on your drawing. You "
"can visualize them as real-world camera filters that can make a photo darker "
"or blurrier. Or perhaps like a coffee filter, where only water and coffee "
"gets through, and the ground coffee stays behind."
msgstr ""
"Iragazkiak zure marrazkietan exekutatu ditzakezun gidoi txiki edo eragiketak "
"dira. Irudi bat ilunago edo lausoago egin ditzaketen mundu errealeko kamera-"
"iragazkiak bezala irudikatu ditzakezu. Edo agian kafe-iragazki bat bezala, "
"nondik ura eta kafea bakarrik iragaten den, eta kafe hondarrak atzean "
"gelditzen diren."

#: ../../reference_manual/filters.rst:9
msgid ""
"Filters are unique to digital painting in terms of complexity, and their "
"part of the painting pipeline. Some artists only use filters to adjust their "
"colors a little. Others, using Filter Layers and Filter Masks use them to "
"dynamically update a part of an image to be filtered. This way, they can "
"keep the original underneath without changing the original image. This is a "
"part of a technique called 'non-destructive' editing."
msgstr ""
"Iragazkiak bereziak dira marrazketa digitalean, konplexutasunari dagokionez, "
"eta margotze-prozesuan duten eginkizunagatik. Artista batzuek koloreak "
"pixkabat doitzeko bakarrik erabiltzen dituzte. Beste batzuek, Iragazki-"
"geruzak eta Iragazki-maskarak erabiliz, irudi bateko iragazi beharreko atal "
"bat dinamikoki eguneratzeko erabiltzen dituzte. Horrela, jatorrizko irudia "
"azpian, aldatu gabe mantendu dezakete. Hau da edizio 'ez suntsitzailea' "
"deitzen den teknikaren zati bat da."

#: ../../reference_manual/filters.rst:11
msgid ""
"Filters can be accessed via the :guilabel:`Filters` menu. Krita has two "
"types of filters: Internal and G'MIC filters."
msgstr ""
"Iragazkiak :guilabel:`Iragazkiak` menuaren bidez atzi daitezke. Kritak bi "
"iragazki mota ditu: Barnekoak eta G'MIC iragazkiak."

#: ../../reference_manual/filters.rst:13
msgid ""
"Internal filters are often multithreaded, and can thus be used with the :ref:"
"`filter_brush_engine` or the :ref:`filter_layers` and :ref:`filter_masks`."
msgstr ""
"Barneko iragazkiak askotan hari anitzekoak dira, eta beraz,  :ref:"
"`filter_brush_engine` edo :ref:`filter_layers` eta :ref:`filter_masks`-ekin "
"batera erabil daitezke."
